@startuml TSS_Paquetes_Java
!include ../_estilo.iuml
title TechSupply Solutions — Dependencias entre paquetes
left to right direction
package "com.techsupply.erp_backend" {
  package "common.api" as Common
  package "security" as Security
  package "maestros" as Masters
  package "compras" as Purchases
  package "inventario" as Inventory
  package "ventas" as Sales
  package "audit" as Audit
  package "notifications" as Notify
  package "contabilidad" as Finance
  package "recursos humanos" as HR
  package "reportería" as Reports
}
Masters ..> Common
Purchases ..> Common
Inventory ..> Common
Sales ..> Common
Audit ..> Common
Purchases ..> Masters : consulta catálogos
Purchases ..> Inventory : recepción
Sales ..> Masters : consulta catálogos
Sales ..> Inventory : reserva y despacho
Purchases ..> Finance : documento validado
Sales ..> Finance : documento validado
HR ..> Finance : nómina aprobada
Masters ..> Audit
Purchases ..> Audit
Inventory ..> Audit
Sales ..> Audit
Reports ..> Security : autorización
Notify ..> Security : destinatario
note bottom of Common
  DTO, paginación y errores HTTP compartidos.
  Los módulos mantienen reglas y persistencia propias.
end note
@enduml
